{"id":"665901","name":"枣泥饼","author":"putimama","authorId":"8334261","desc":"","cover":"images/665901/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"普通面粉","amount":"200g"},{"name":"水","amount":"110g"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"2g"},{"name":"泡打粉","amount":"2g"}],"sub":[{"name":"枣泥","amount":"200g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"枣泥馅料10个，每个23g。","img":"images/665901/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"将面和成稍软的面团。","img":"images/665901/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"分成10剂子，逐个包入枣泥馅料。","img":"images/665901/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"擀成小圆饼。","img":"images/665901/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"切割成花朵型状。","img":"images/665901/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"逐个做好造型。","img":"images/665901/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"做了两盘饧发一下(覆盖防干)。","img":"images/665901/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"烤箱先预热5至10分钟，上火180度，下火160度烤18至20分钟。","img":"images/665901/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"鸡蛋黄打散待用。","img":"images/665901/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"枣泥饼烧8分钟取出刷蛋黄液，再继续烤。","img":"images/665901/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"这是第二盘放入烤箱，同样温度与时间烤制。","img":"images/665901/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"枣泥饼出炉啦，造型美观、漂亮！","img":"images/665901/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"枣泥饼颜值高、口感喧软、口味香甜。","img":"images/665901/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电烤箱\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}